  "status": "The complete front-matter coherence pass reads all 305 original lines and all 305 revised lines of the Introduction, conventions and main document, together with the companion root as a structural interface. It includes an actual revised prebuild read and a complete second revised read after the page inspections. The companion root contains one unchanged proof; its recursive mathematical inputs retain their earlier actual review scopes. The opening connects growth, integrability, curvature and analytic approximation. Transitions connect mass bounds, the energy obstruction, Gauduchon traces, envelopes and model volumes. The equation discussion separates relative-envelope membership from bounded difference in a prescribed ordinary type, and the reading route follows the chapter order and all three appendix constructions. All definitions, displayed formulas, mathematical hypotheses and conclusions are retained. Both covers use the current rebuilding date, October 8, 2026. The conventions and main root are unchanged. 384 of 386 prior book files are unchanged. All 1236 author proof bodies, 1325 mathematical statement environments and 23 formal question bodies remain byte-exact. All citation commands and internal reference targets/order in the four-unit scope are preserved; two reference-command initial letters change case to fit their new sentence position. No compiled label number or printed locator changes. All 1562 post-front-matter pages and all 16 post-cover companion pages have byte-exact text; this comparison does not constitute a new complete mathematical rereading. Original visual scope covers 38 book/interface pages (25 directly inspected, 13 exact text/render carries); revised scope covers 50 pages (7 direct, 43 exact text/render carries). All original seven sheets and both final sheets were actually viewed. The post-page-view full-unit read needs no further changes, so the inspected first author build is final. Main-book and companion logs are clean. The main book has 1562 printed and 1590 physical pages, 9492 valid internal links and 968 index destinations matching source hyperpages. The served PDF checksum, homepage description and exact successful Actions/github-pages deployment are verified for public commit 6d6650c19417cc8d8a0cea391f68a6f88978ee1b. All 44 full catalogue descriptions and assessment scopes are retained, with 214 single-page and 26 range locators checked. The existing 40 open assessments remain; neither general P14 nor the general singular-space problem is closed. Actual fresh reconstruction passes: 2709 safe archive paths, 2708 current payload checksums and 383 byte-exact book-source files; main-book and companion page texts match, both logs are clean and publication is disabled. Final metadata packaging reuses these actually rebuilt outputs. The final saved-source compile_latex_document call (cell944) returned that this app tool is no longer available through dynamic tools; no callable alternate compiler or tool-search entry was discovered. Native preview compilation remains unverified; the existing source and editor are preserved. Continue related primary literature and the active open-problem program, checking incoming author progress before integration.",
